Experimental PHP/Slim HTTP application. Composer owns PHP dependencies and scripts. The recipe uses PHP 8.5.12, Slim 4.15.3, Slim PSR-7 1.8.0{{#if (ne phpTesting "none")}} and PHPUnit 13.4.3{{/if}} as its minimum patch versions. PHP 8.6 is outside this recipe's declared version range.
